WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,600
Only after I died once did I understand

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:07,600
A good girl only gets one good word in the end

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:11,600
And the bad girl gets everything

4
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:17,440
Jingyi, can we meet?

5
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:25,870
I'm not here to deliver breakfast to the people I like, right?

6
00:00:25,870 --> 00:00:28,870
God, who would let such a handsome guy

7
00:00:28,870 --> 00:00:29,870
Ling Zhen is waiting for himself

8
00:00:29,870 --> 00:00:41,860
Is Jingyi still sleeping?

9
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:43,860
I promised to bring her breakfast today

10
00:00:43,860 --> 00:00:44,860
I didn’t expect it would rain halfway

11
00:00:44,860 --> 00:00:45,860
She didn't reply to my message

12
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:47,860
Can you tell me when she wakes up?

13
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:48,860
I'll buy another one

14
00:00:48,860 --> 00:00:51,040
You don't have to wait any longer

15
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:53,040
She can't eat your breakfast

16
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:56,540
Jingyi has a boyfriend

17
00:00:56,540 --> 00:00:59,580
Mr. Jiang Mu, why don’t we be together?

18
00:00:59,580 --> 00:01:03,980
Miko we are not suitable

19
00:01:03,980 --> 00:01:05,980
Of course I know why she dislikes me

20
00:01:05,980 --> 00:01:07,980
After all, who would have thought

21
00:01:07,980 --> 00:01:09,980
The most beautiful girl in BGI sends Jingyi her best friend

22
00:01:09,980 --> 00:01:11,980
She is a famous hater of women in Hua University.

23
00:01:11,980 --> 00:01:13,980
You clearly know that I like Jingyi

24
00:01:13,980 --> 00:01:14,980
How could you steal her person?

25
00:01:14,980 --> 00:01:16,980
Jingyi, she regards you as her best friend

26
00:01:16,980 --> 00:01:19,980
Yes, the suitor of my pretty best friend

27
00:01:19,980 --> 00:01:21,980
It does sound like there is no bottom line at all

28
00:01:21,980 --> 00:01:25,210
It's a pity that after dying once

29
00:01:25,210 --> 00:01:29,240
The bottom line is that this is the least valuable thing to me.

30
00:01:29,240 --> 00:01:31,240
There is no shortage of suitors around Jingyi

31
00:01:31,240 --> 00:01:33,240
Handsome, in good shape, rich

32
00:01:33,240 --> 00:01:35,240
Can help her academically

33
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:38,240
What makes you think you can impress her and me easily?

34
00:01:38,240 --> 00:01:40,270
Even if Jingyi won’t choose me

35
00:01:40,270 --> 00:01:41,270
It's not your turn

36
00:01:41,270 --> 00:01:42,270
I thought you were just ugly

37
00:01:42,270 --> 00:01:44,270
I didn't expect him to be so shameless

38
00:01:44,270 --> 00:01:45,270
I'm shameless

39
00:01:45,270 --> 00:01:46,270
You and I are both in the physical education department

40
00:01:46,270 --> 00:01:47,270
Know that I am a good friend who sent Jingyi away

41
00:01:47,270 --> 00:01:48,270
You pretend to be cold and warm to me

42
00:01:48,270 --> 00:01:49,270
Release ambiguous information

43
00:01:49,270 --> 00:01:51,270
You deliberately used me to get close to Jingyi

44
00:01:51,270 --> 00:01:52,270
Who are you taking advantage of first?

45
00:01:52,270 --> 00:01:53,270
This Miko looks stupid

46
00:01:53,270 --> 00:01:56,270
You can actually see through me and think about me carefully

47
00:01:56,270 --> 00:01:57,270
Jiang Muye

48
00:01:57,270 --> 00:01:58,270
Why don't we make a deal?

49
00:01:58,270 --> 00:02:01,100
Miko seems different from before

50
00:02:01,100 --> 00:02:03,460
Why do you feel so energetic today?

51
00:02:03,460 --> 00:02:05,460
Taking advantage of my boyfriend's identity

52
00:02:05,460 --> 00:02:08,460
You can get closer to sending Jingyi

53
00:02:08,460 --> 00:02:15,920
in return

54
00:02:15,920 --> 00:02:17,920
I want you to fulfill your incredible responsibility to me

55
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:20,460
I can't do anything intimate with you

56
00:02:20,460 --> 00:02:21,460
Stop your wishful thinking

57
00:02:21,460 --> 00:02:24,820
This is what I mean by sincerity

58
00:02:24,820 --> 00:02:26,910
First-come-first-serve access to the water tower

59
00:02:26,910 --> 00:02:29,910
Let’s see the strength for a thousand first
